        // Since we cannot access internal mapping directly, we instead observe behavior via whether the contract would allow re-locking:
        // The contract requires guesses[msg.sender].block == 0 to allow lockInGuess. So after settle, lockInGuess should be callable again by the same address.
        // We therefore try to call lockInGuess again from Runner: if guesses[runner].block == 0 the call will succeed; if non-zero it will revert.

